n probability p”.\n  - Loss is shown as `L_sft = L_CrossEntropy(Cp, p)`.\n- Finding/claim shown by the figure:\n  - The diagram illustrates supervised fine-tuning of a language model decoder to generate cell descriptions from gene-expression-derived embeddings plus instruction and prompt embeddings."]}

